00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:59.909
interest rates of 5.25%.

00:02:59.909 --> 00:03:03.930
Investing in bonds now means locking in high
rates before the Federal Reserve starts decreasing

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:06.200
them once again.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.060
Companies and legendary investors are well
aware of this and that’s why they’ve been

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:13.930
investing hundreds of billions into bonds
over the past year.

